Subject: Springleaf Drum: let the heuristic AI consider casting it (DRAFT, unmeasured)
Why: AiController drops every card marked AI:RemoveDeck:All from its list of candidate plays
  unless Flat Monte Carlo is on, so with the default AI Springleaf Drum was never cast (Azorius
  Momo baseline: seen in 230 games, cast in 0). Removing the hint lets the normal permanent and
  mana logic decide. Not yet checked: whether the AI can pay the Drum's own mana ability
  (T, tap an untapped creature); if it casts the Drum but never uses it, this makes the deck worse.
Measured: NOT MEASURED. Draft only; it lives in pending/ so setup --build does not apply it.

